{"overview":"مردی که در یک مسیر بی‌پایان و استریل مترو گیر کرده است، به دنبال خروجی ۸ می‌رود. قوانین مأموریت او ساده است: هیچ چیز غیرعادی را نادیده نگیر. اگر ناهنجاری‌ای پیدا کردی، بلافاصله برگرد. اگر نه، ادامه بده و از خروجی ۸ خارج شو. حتی یک‌بار هم نادیده گرفتن، او را به ابتدا برمی‌گرداند. آیا او می‌تواند به هدفش برسد و از این راهرو بی‌نهایت فرار کند؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"A man trapped in an endless sterile subway passageway sets out to find Exit 8. The rules of his quest are simple: do not overlook anything out of the ordinary. If you discover an anomaly, turn back immediately. If you don’t, carry on. Then leave from Exit 8. But even a single oversight will send him back to the beginning. Will he ever reach his goal and escape this infinite corridor?","tagline_en":"Turn back.","runtime":95,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["川村元気"],"crew_en":["Genki Kawamura"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"二宮和也","role":"Lost Man","photo":"/4mxogZeEPZiVrnJ4L8ICvOJONfs.jpg","en":"Kazunari Ninomiya"},{"name":"河内大和","role":"Walking Man","photo":"/8CUS41LVMlBH5Am2uZC3F44yyDw.jpg","en":"Yamato Kochi"},{"name":"浅沼成","role":"The Boy","photo":"/orV4an2sD7PgLpHCulgCBDgs1bl.jpg","en":"Naru Asanuma"},{"name":"花瀬琴音","role":"High School Student","photo":"/xSimDM5cdwBtVAa7FJ36gFyMC0p.jpg","en":"Kotone Hanase"},{"name":"小松菜奈","role":"Lost Man's Partner","photo":"/74WvpjdZkE5kYSEHwG9E4f0gVKk.jpg","en":"Nana Komatsu"},{"name":"大塚ヒロタ","role":"Screaming Man on Train","photo":"/fWxZgSLwAl3JAbLHoTyZDcGTI1m.jpg","en":"Hirota Otsuka"},{"name":"中島多羅","role":"Mother on Train","photo":"/6GWRQWO1NcHFoRVlp5L3ZmL69Ed.jpg","en":"Tara Nakashima"},{"name":"曽田怜央","role":"Child","photo":"/v63pfKMiVrMidWfqhEU213pZQSS.jpg","en":"Reo Soda"},{"name":"上田実規朗","role":"Man on Train","photo":"/wsAhgcda1yuPfAAlgGNt5L4FlYd.jpg","en":"Mikio Ueda"},{"name":"ヒカキン","role":"Passerby","photo":"/wuBzUSQJn8YApxQ35MEswALqWyi.jpg","en":"HIKAKIN"}],"trailer":"zzEDWwhtAHc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https